Kernel
------

The kernel is maintained separately in linux-sm8450-liuqin, based on
https://github.com/sm8450-mainline/linux.git. Its COPYING, LICENSES directory,
file-level SPDX identifiers and original authorship are retained. The exact
revision is recorded in kernel/source.json.

