Charging status display
-----------------------

device/charger-mode/font-8x16.h contains the unchanged font bytes from Linux
lib/fonts/font_8x16.c, revision c1061313feee of linux-sm8450-liuqin.
The font and liuqin-charger-screen.c carry GPL-2.0-only identifiers; see
device/charger-mode/COPYING. The font was generated by cpi2fnt; its byte-array
container is adapted for the userspace charging status renderer.

